fixture jump_air_jump
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump: "Double jump: 1 per airtime, 85% of ground jump velocity" (Ash has it)
room test/flat
frames 80
input
  0..5 jump
  12..30 jump
  40 jump
end
expect
  at 0 air_jumps=1
  # 85% of 3840 is 3264.
  at 12 event.air_jump=1 vy=-3264 air_jumps=0
  # A second air jump in the same airtime does nothing.
  at 40 event.air_jump=0 event.jump=0
  mark land 13..79 event.land=1
  at land air_jumps=1
end
